        396.11993408203125,
        563.0453491210938,
        405.1858825683594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "1024 trajectory samples per prior with δ = 0.05. The trajectory",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        407.9559326171875,
        563.0354614257812,
        417.0218811035156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "costs were normalized before optimization to achieve tighter",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        419.9513244628906,
        563.0354614257812,
        428.8578796386719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "PAC bounds. The constraint violation bound penalty was set to",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        431.78631591796875,
        563.0353393554688,
        440.69287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "γ = 2 in the cluttered environments and γ = 4 in the concave",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
