        563.04541015625,
        452.52886962890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "trap environments. These were empirically determined to yield",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        455.45831298828125,
        563.0355224609375,
        464.3648681640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the best performance in these environments. When running",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        467.2943115234375,
        563.03564453125,
        476.20086669921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "MPPI, the sampled trajectory costs were similarly normalized",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        479.1293029785156,
        563.0355834960938,
        488.0358581542969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and summed with a constraint violation indicator multiplied by",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        490.9653015136719,
        563.035400390625,
        499.8718566894531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "γ. The same number of timesteps, ∆t, H, and M were used,",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        502.64190673828125,
        563.03564453125,
        511.7078552246094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "along with a temperature of γt = 0.35 and sampling variance",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        514.4768676757812,
        563.04345703125,
        524.8186645507812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of Σϵ = 0.01. Both PAC-NMPC and MPPI were allowed to",
      "bbox": [
        311.97796630859375,
        526.3128662109375,
        563.0433349609375,
        536.6536865234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "run for as many iterations as possible within the replanning",
      "bbox": [
        311.97796630859375,
