        712.52783203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "recover. The actor policy was unable to explicitly enforce con-",
      "bbox": [
        311.97796630859375,
        715.457275390625,
        563.0355224609375,
        724.3638305664062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "straints which resulted in occasional violations. Our approach",
      "bbox": [
        311.97796630859375,
